                "Evaluation of the entire cross-section and the entire length of the deep foundation element measuring heat generated by curing cement to assess the quality of drilled shafts/bored piles, augered cast in place (ACIP)/continuous flight auger (CFA) or drilled displacement piles, slurry walls, barrettes, soil nails, and jet grouted columns.rnrnEvaluates concrete quality inside and outside the reinforcing cagernAccelerates construction with tests conducted during concrete curingrnReveals necking or inclusions, bulges, variations in concrete cover, shape of shaft and cage alignmentrnThermal Wire® Cables can replace access tubesrnAll Thermal Wire Cable temperature sensors are NIST traceablernThermal Aggregator Units (TAG) allow for real-time data review via PDI Atlas™ Secure Cloud Services",
                "Data collected by the TIP&trade; system is downloaded to a computer for analysis by the TIP&trade; Reporter Software. The TIP&trade; Reporter Software",
