          "image": "storage/category/wastewater-6a1f1d9fb1f2e.jpg",
          "description": "<h3>Wastewater Testing Laboratory Services</h3>rnrn<p>QC Lab Solution provides comprehensive <strong>Wastewater Testing Laboratory Services in Bangladesh</strong> to help industries, municipalities, and environmental organizations monitor and manage wastewater quality. Accurate wastewater analysis is essential for ensuring environmental compliance, protecting public health, and maintaining sustainable industrial operations.</p>rnrn<p>Our laboratory offers advanced testing solutions for industrial effluents, sewage water, treatment plant performance evaluation, and environmental monitoring programs. Using modern analytical instruments and internationally recognized testing standards, we deliver reliable and accurate results for regulatory reporting and process optimization.</p>rnrn<h3>Our Wastewater Testing Capabilities</h3>rnrn<p>We perform a wide range of wastewater quality assessments, including:</p>rnrn<ul>rn\t<li>pH Analysis</li>rn\t<li>Biological Oxygen Demand (BOD)</li>rn\t<li>Chemical Oxygen Demand (COD)</li>rn\t<li>Total Suspended Solids (TSS)</li>rn\t<li>Total Dissolved Solids (TDS)</li>rn\t<li>Oil and Grease Testing</li>rn\t<li>Dissolved Oxygen (DO)</li>rn\t<li>Ammonia and Nitrogen Analysis</li>rn\t<li>Phosphate Testing</li>rn\t<li>Sulfate and Chloride Analysis</li>rn\t<li>Heavy Metals Testing</li>rn\t<li>Conductivity Measurement</li>rn\t<li>Turbidity Analysis</li>rn\t<li>Toxicity Assessment</li>rn\t<li>Industrial Effluent Characterization</li>rn</ul>rnrn<h3>Applications</h3>rnrn<p>Our wastewater testing services support:</p>rnrn<ul>rn\t<li>Textile Industries</li>rn\t<li>Garment Manufacturing Plants</li>rn\t<li>Pharmaceutical Industries</li>rn\t<li>Food and Beverage Processing Plants</li>rn\t<li>Power Plants</li>rn\t<li>Chemical Industries</li>rn\t<li>Municipal Wastewater Treatment Facilities</li>rn\t<li>Environmental Impact Assessment (EIA) Projects</li>rn\t<li>Regulatory Compliance Monitoring</li>rn</ul>rnrn<h3>Why Choose QC Lab Solution?</h3>rnrn<ul>rn\t<li>Experienced Environmental Testing Specialists</li>rn\t<li>Modern Laboratory Equipment</li>rn\t<li>Accurate and Reliable Results</li>rn\t<li>Compliance with International Testing Standards</li>rn\t<li>Fast Turnaround Time</li>rn\t<li>Customized Testing Programs</li>rn\t<li>Technical Support and Environmental Consultancy</li>rn</ul>rnrn<h3>Ensure Environmental Compliance</h3>rnrn<p>Regular wastewater testing is critical for meeting environmental regulations and maintaining efficient wastewater treatment systems. QC Lab Solution provides dependable laboratory testing services to help organizations achieve compliance, reduce environmental risks, and support sustainable development initiatives throughout Bangladesh.</p>",
